<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends up on steep drop in call rate.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends up on steep drop in call rate.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sept 9 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (H)	99.13		  99.06</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The benchmark March three-month Euroyen rate contract ended Tokyo's day session higher on Monday due to a steep fall in the key call rate, traders said.</p>
<p>The benchmark overnight call rate fell to 0.38 percent, down sharply from Friday's 0.43 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The fall in the call rate reflected the fact that the Bank of Japan's bill buying operations last week had met with a weak market response,&quot; said a senior money trader</p>
